event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_019e3V8xXTNwixUZpiJScEm8", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 7933, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01D4GnXtLWQmavh4RJQ4LCyH", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 8233, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01D4GnXtLWQmavh4RJQ4LCyH", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 8233, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01D4GnXtLWQmavh4RJQ4LCyH", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 10281, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01FM7N7yeYPPRPsAxvxWtJf1", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate was 0.18). Per the runbook, I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production, in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). After the rollback, the service reports v2.3.0 in all regions, healthy: true, error rate 0.002. v2.3.1 remains unhealthy in production and should not be redeployed until it is fixed. Staging build v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and confirm checkout health before closing.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-2025-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 10881, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01FM7N7yeYPPRPsAxvxWtJf1", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-2025-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 10881, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01FM7N7yeYPPRPsAxvxWtJf1", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 12352, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all production regions and opened a SEV2 incident (INC-0001), which paged on-call.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.1 was unhealthy in production, and v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy there. Every region (us-east, us-west, eu-west) now runs v2.3.0.\n- **Current state:** checkout-api reports healthy, with an error rate of 0.002, down from 0.18 on v2.3.1.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure, the rollback, and the current state. It also notes that v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until it is fixed, and that the investigation needs to be followed up before the incident is closed.\n\nNo change-manager approval was needed, since v2.3.0 had been healthy in production.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_018mEppMGcukJwCrGksND77T", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01DvqVE5TpFswxEdcg3es2Gr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0. v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production, so I'll roll back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_019e3V8xXTNwixUZpiJScEm8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_